#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133466 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133911 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "28142e26-f6c7-54c9-9c16-035c75f7659f" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a Matrix With A Zero Row/Column or Two Identical Rows/Columns"}] :question/id #uuid "bb2795c3-6359-50d8-9531-1e9dfae7a2ce" :question/math-academy-id "e-10994" :question/problem "Find $5\\det(A)-\\det(B),$ where \n![](images/3e/3e712748e8fc744fc15cd6d7c1549aaba236b3254d9c65289288133e5daefad4.svg)" :question/worked-solution "Let's examine each matrix in turn.\n\n- Since $A$ has two identical columns, we obtain\n![](images/0a/0a19cbfc3164a365bb02386d16bac01562a36b39de41a4b2909e4397684f2cac.svg)\n\n- Since $B$ is a diagonal matrix, its determinant is given by the product of the elements of the main diagonal: \n\n$$\n\\det(B) = 3 \\cdot (-4) \\cdot (-2) = 24\n$$\n\nTherefore, $5\\det(A)-\\det(B) = 5 \\cdot 0 - 24 = -24.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133467 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133912 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "8aef330a-81b3-56c4-9559-67df673e8687" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a Matrix With Two Proportional Rows/Columns"}] :question/id #uuid "dc780837-b763-5ba9-981a-2373afcb524a" :question/math-academy-id "e-10995" :question/problem "Which of the following determinants are equal to $0?$\n\n![](images/f1/f1906279bd2a08c55aad73b8974edcccfdd3b156c5d471d185e2edc61e538528.svg)" :question/worked-solution "Let's examine each of the given determinants in turn.\n\n- The matrix $A$ has proportional rows: \n![](images/f7/f7bdc5e767fbd22592a2b9bf8e51517ad6927e7edc495fd7a6ce73b7ae29e4a1.svg)\nAs a result, $|A| = 0.$\n\n- The matrix $B$ is a triangular matrix, so \n\n$$\n|B| = (-1) \\cdot 4 \\cdot (-3) = 12 \\neq 0.\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ has a zero row: \n![](images/c1/c1211b127ba1daa7863aef3501287f93fda48791ba3a072b98b777bd54ff31d7.svg)\nAs a result, $|C| = 0.$\n\nTherefore, only $|A|$ and $|C|$ are equal to $0.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133468 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133913 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "abaeea03-6a2a-5d37-a2af-a9ea109175ad" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying the Reasons Why a Determinant Equals Zero"}] :question/id #uuid "33ca37e5-c598-52a2-861f-2d5bfa6fd571" :question/math-academy-id "e-10996" :question/problem "![](images/b3/b36961dd90e73504bf46d63827d1ea68292c01a7990f8fa3eb00eee62a4b1813.svg)\n\nConsider the matrix given above. Identify **all** of the reasons why one can conclude that $|A|=0.$\n\nI. $A$ has a zero column\n\nII. $A$ has proportional rows\n\nIII. $A$ has identical columns" :question/worked-solution "Let's examine each of the statements in turn.\n\n- $A$ has a zero column: \n![](images/ce/ce6418b20309f4fdf0fdde343eef9fd6fdaa547d40207382c512537c5e509296.svg)\n\n- $A$ has proportional rows: \n![](images/cd/cdfd4bbe379b1e1c68412fa70c67e4ba9e355a329bb8f457ecb17523755f2ea1.svg)\n\n- $A$ does *not* have identical columns.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186400867 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133911 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "28142e26-f6c7-54c9-9c16-035c75f7659f" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a Matrix With A Zero Row/Column or Two Identical Rows/Columns"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f03dd7eb-af5f-5f22-813b-7f3d5b84651c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$|B|$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186400869} {:answer/id #uuid "ab86d5e2-989c-5d49-9b2d-7a183fd53e17" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$|B|$ and $|C|$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186400870} {:answer/id #uuid "da8626ef-a38f-59a8-a718-2155b988e445" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$|C|$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186400871} {:answer/id #uuid "c0fe0f31-e9db-50f1-a23b-a66578e23d9f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$|A|$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186400872} {:answer/id #uuid "1485ab74-1a6a-53e5-9aaf-e407a69b362d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$|A|$ and $|B|$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186400873}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ab86d5e2-989c-5d49-9b2d-7a183fd53e17" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$|B|$ and $|C|$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186400870} :answer-field/id #uuid "d252fa00-ae50-5d73-8bce-ecc15224f399" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186400868}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "3c1bd5a4-43fd-5d63-843c-209b976b49d5" :question/math-academy-id "q-140046" :question/problem "Which of the following determinants are equal to $0?$\n\n$$\n|A|=|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -\\sqrt{3} & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{6} & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 18 & \\sqrt{6} & \\sqrt{3} & 4\\end{aligned}|,\\,|B|=|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|,\\,|C|=|\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ -10 & 4\\end{aligned}|\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's examine each of the given determinants in turn.\n\n- The $A$ is a triangular matrix, we obtain\n\n$$\n|A|=2\\cdot 1\\cdot 1\\cdot 4=8\\ne 0.\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ has identical columns:\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nAs a result, $|B|=0.$\n\n- Since $C$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix, its determinant is:\n\n$$\ndet(C)=5\\cdot 4-(-2)\\cdot (-10)=0\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $|B|$ and $|C|$ are equal to $0.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186272011 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133912 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "8aef330a-81b3-56c4-9559-67df673e8687" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a Matrix With Two Proportional Rows/Columns"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1321a890-eb6a-54ac-bf48-1d4c77ff2d9b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186269436} {:answer/id #uuid "2417ace3-b1df-55bb-9e6e-f0cf724a7d7c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186269584} {:answer/id #uuid "445c99d0-1565-5d0f-bd0a-b81957ffc9f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186269889} {:answer/id #uuid "b8d5f2c0-248a-5010-b938-a0307212261a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186270902} {:answer/id #uuid "fe1fdb0e-edd1-53d9-ac51-6c3cbff27cc4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186271495}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b8d5f2c0-248a-5010-b938-a0307212261a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186270902} :answer-field/id #uuid "6af39b6a-785f-556e-9462-97889783ccd5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186271701}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "51a6e7e0-f39c-5b8c-9665-45f89b4bef77" :question/math-academy-id "q-140047" :question/problem "Find $det(A)-2det(B)$, where \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 0 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 4 & -1 & 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's examine each matrix in turn.\n\n- Since $A$ has proportional rows, we obtain\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 0 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\,⟹\\,det(A)=0.\n$$\n\n- Since $B$ is a triangular matrix, we obtain\n\n$$\n|B|=-1\\cdot 1\\cdot 3=-3\n$$\n\nTherefore, $det(A)-2det(B)=0-2\\cdot (-3)=6.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186272013 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133913 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "abaeea03-6a2a-5d37-a2af-a9ea109175ad" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying the Reasons Why a Determinant Equals Zero"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9dcaf5cb-763f-5cf3-9460-94fc22fd63a3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464090} {:answer/id #uuid "94b51605-0792-5dfb-9caa-c9f83344d279" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464091}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "94b51605-0792-5dfb-9caa-c9f83344d279" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464091} :answer-field/id #uuid "977b3534-4011-5dfd-a7b9-79927cd06b86" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464979} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fc8b5695-d93e-519e-8d9e-dc6c8a41f9b4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464092} {:answer/id #uuid "6b733140-0c4b-5274-8eb8-dcc1ee96785c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464093}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fc8b5695-d93e-519e-8d9e-dc6c8a41f9b4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464092} :answer-field/id #uuid "9e5c0b84-632c-50f3-8754-70310b21a57f" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464980} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f726adc9-d1dc-521c-8654-53c52267101e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464094} {:answer/id #uuid "94789da1-7829-587f-bfab-9c55f7f2211d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464095}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f726adc9-d1dc-521c-8654-53c52267101e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464094} :answer-field/id #uuid "121070ea-b2d0-524b-8159-ea2fbac7bd33" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464981}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "14e63fd3-62b7-575e-b489-4cda5c20ed53" :question/math-academy-id "q-140050" :question/problem "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -4 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 7\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the matrix given above. Identify **all** of the reasons why one can conclude that $|A|=0?$\n- **I.** $A$ has proportional columns\n- **II.** $A$ has identical columns\n- **III.** $A$ has identical rows\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "Let's examine each of the statements in turn.\n\n- $A$ has proportional columns: \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -4 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 7\\end{aligned}]\\,✓\n$$\n\n- $A$ does *not* have identical columns.\n\n- $A$ does *not* have identical rows.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186329652 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133913 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "abaeea03-6a2a-5d37-a2af-a9ea109175ad" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying the Reasons Why a Determinant Equals Zero"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4ecd3639-37c9-5252-aa12-89458787a945" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467506} {:answer/id #uuid "4a17d94f-af1d-51db-b4a1-c3f5d3f929bf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467507}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4ecd3639-37c9-5252-aa12-89458787a945" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467506} :answer-field/id #uuid "bdf24f07-c421-5ff2-bb73-41cf2a1bb824" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468474} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d6ede3e0-89dd-5960-bddd-720db62f0e98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467508} {:answer/id #uuid "9298449a-ad9c-56e2-ac99-09c0dc4fccc9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467509}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9298449a-ad9c-56e2-ac99-09c0dc4fccc9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467509} :answer-field/id #uuid "c910b60c-d032-56a5-9324-9976088368c8" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468475} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7b966358-ec55-5272-a99d-1379768d11ab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467510} {:answer/id #uuid "7421f4b3-99e2-5360-a4df-4fcdc8cb3bc8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467511}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7421f4b3-99e2-5360-a4df-4fcdc8cb3bc8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467511} :answer-field/id #uuid "5de5adf3-aa9f-52a9-9f7f-305d17cf782d" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468476}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "fffc6699-6d6e-50bb-8cc3-7d4f0e3f1d17" :question/math-academy-id "q-42460" :question/problem "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & 1 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 2 & 4 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & 1 & 5 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -1 & 8\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \nConsider the matrix given above. Identify **all** of the reasons why one can conclude that $|A|=0?$\n- **I.** $A$ has a zero row\n- **II.** $A$ has two proportional columns\n- **III.** $A$ has two identical rows\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's examine each of the statements in turn.\n\n- $A$ does *not* have a zero row.\n\n- $A$ has two proportional columns:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & 1 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 2 & 4 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & 1 & 5 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -1 & 8\\end{aligned}]\\,✓\n$$\n\n- $A$ has two identical rows: \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & 1 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 2 & 4 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & 1 & 5 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -1 & 8\\end{aligned}]\\,✓\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186329653 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133913 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "abaeea03-6a2a-5d37-a2af-a9ea109175ad" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying the Reasons Why a Determinant Equals Zero"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a7a447b8-7f09-5270-aca4-b17f9770d76a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467512} {:answer/id #uuid "20bcc14b-7336-54e8-a261-0dbcc7509b69" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467513}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "20bcc14b-7336-54e8-a261-0dbcc7509b69" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467513} :answer-field/id #uuid "0b661764-dcf8-5eba-bedc-e2374ffb5a83" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468477} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5f27d7c7-943c-56e2-9e1a-eb7154c900ae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467514} {:answer/id #uuid "9113697f-b704-5925-b69c-e204a21d502a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467515}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5f27d7c7-943c-56e2-9e1a-eb7154c900ae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467514} :answer-field/id #uuid "ba64ddd8-bbc6-577f-b73b-e524ed587e49" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468478} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "68448d61-0ddf-531f-8009-f672e592a9b1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467516} {:answer/id #uuid "84b46424-4893-5f87-bbc8-ae085db91a24" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467517}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "68448d61-0ddf-531f-8009-f672e592a9b1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467516} :answer-field/id #uuid "b2a724bd-e000-5d5f-b930-fed8c566efc4" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468479}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "59d4edee-acd9-59e0-80f8-ec390e2e0ee0" :question/math-academy-id "q-42465" :question/problem "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 8 & 2 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & \\sqrt{6} & 9 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 4 & \\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \n\nConsider the matrix given above. Identify **all** of the reasons why one can conclude that $|A|=0?$\n\nI. $A$ has proportional rows\n\nII. $A$ has identical columns\n\nIII. $A$ has a zero column\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's examine each of the statements in turn.\n\n- $A$ has proportional rows: \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 8 & 2 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & \\sqrt{6} & 9 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 4 & \\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}]\\,✓\n$$\n\n- $A$ does *not* have identical columns.\n\n- $A$ does *not* have a zero column.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186415476 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133913 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "abaeea03-6a2a-5d37-a2af-a9ea109175ad" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying the Reasons Why a Determinant Equals Zero"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "071ee791-8aa1-59a9-829e-f23787b55570" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473130} {:answer/id #uuid "be789ad4-7b1c-517c-b647-7e02fbdc4606" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473131}] :answer-f